  "body": "Issue #4: this experiment tests isolated reuse of repeated contexts within one archive validation. It preserves every previous scientific file and all original decoding/scoring/reference work. The observed implementation is slower, and the preregistered complete-identity gate FAILED. It is not deployed.\n\n[Prospective protocol](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/7c599b2/docs/context-reuse.md) / [preimplementation issue plan](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/4#issuecomment-6950002262) preceded source9ebd590. All447 predecessor files/128pins stay unchanged; source450 fingerprint901415dc66139b48866bdf07dba9231e63fbaf3d0267d87af33b31028e4999a9. All six source roles and exact tested tools were [public0580beb](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/0580beb/results/context-reuse/checks.json), actual runtimes/alluv/whole checkout tree verified. Initial hosted31293%/25min timeout and exact retry/carried311 execution lineage remain.\n\n[Own proof raw4da1704](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/4da1704/results/context-reuse/software-raw-manifest.json) was public and its verifier ACTUALLY exited0 before fresh reference use. Complete own9.022293542/180s; inner8.925335792 against startup-adjusted179.998911374998. Actual software replay unchanged/0roots; separate factory fixtures2roots/6requests/2misses/4hits, isolation/cleanup/nested-engine and independent tiny terminal/pure-reply checks. This is software evidence, not real cost-loader coverage or playing strength.\n\nBoth complete pair children finish3reads/432profiles/1152conditions/3workers. All27 raw files, failed outer result included, were [public00c93ad](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/00c93ad/results/context-reuse/pair-raw-manifest.json) and byte-authenticated BEFORE diagnosis. Full context witnesses match. Exactly four identity fields differ:normalization requests/evaluations918104\u2192602980;validation-cache requests8316\u21928220/hits8290\u21928194. All remaining result fields match, maximum native scalar discrepancy1.8474111129762605e-13chips each. The inherited observation-only identity includes those work counts; requiring fewer construction calls and identical request counts overconstrained the protocol. Original source/gate/failed status remain untouched. The post-outcome projection is NOT prospective admission.\n\nObserved complete ordinary/reuse wall409.749993/486.746614s; parentCPU278.772282/356.275704; workerCPU369.053525/367.353604. Outer900.544028/1800s, bothchildren<900; failure is identity, not deadline. Archive CPU43.22/44.30 versus81.07/81.53 in dependent reads. No full-copy rollout or favorable scientific retry. One ordered rejected comparison is not a stable causal estimate, production forecast or stronger agent.\n\n[Failure report, tables and two reviewed figures](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/267551c/docs/context-reuse.md#rejected-comparison-and-diagnosis--november-17). A separate data-only auditor REQUIRES failure and original parser rejection; complete child/source/journal/clock checks remain. Four numeric exports reproduce BYTEEXACT on actual31117/NP246 and31215/NP254 under103blocked numerical/construction/clone paths,0forbiddencalls,allrawunchanged. [Code/actual-runtime/visual-review receipts](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/267551c/results/context-reuse/diagnosis/manifest.json). Original valid-pair report still rejects. Source450fp remains unchanged; real-data regression preserves rejection/remaining-field equality. Journal130/worklog/current status/3explanation questions updated.\n\nFinal verification passes all six roles on exact `267551c490c47d18ea4aca1fa8444046f2c1e56f`: each local base **5,380 passed / 70 skipped / 150 deselected** (1,407.16 / 1,385.70s), each optional suite **2,288 passed** (992.19 / 909.47s), and both [same-head hosted jobs](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44121382479) **5,380 passed / 70 skipped / 150 deselected / one historical warning** (1,276.51 / 1,327.87s). Actual Python3.11.17/NumPy2.4.6 and3.12.15/2.5.4, every uv selection, hooks and entire checkout tree were verified. Both successful hosted executions belong to attempt2; neither is a carried success. Initial25-minute hosted cancellations, interrupted local regular-file-read stalls and their exact retry lineage remain retained. Fresh /private/tmp local environments preserve the original lockfile/source/test scope. Whole strict typing820, lint/976-file formatting and511reviewed relative destinations/anchors/fences/markers pass. The scientific pair remains REJECTED. Guarded history merge and protected-main saved-data verification are next; no main-completion claim yet.\n\nSelf-review:private caller adapters and bounded graph copies preserve defining scientific functions; original failed outcome cannot be promoted by reporting. Both the contract mismatch and unfavorable timing are retained. Main/user changes untouched during this branch. Closing PR85sixrole/main559/3exports/27raw/10userfiles verification also retained in first batch. Next:finish final checks/protected history merge, then inspect another measured cost before any new optimizer. Runtime912.54/900 and accuracy2.390%/1% remain failed; no training/default/fresh/global/competitive-strength admission. Codex-assisted implementation/execution/drafting; no independent human reviewer, hours or mastery inferred.",
